      "codeSnippet": "INSERT INTO test_sp VALUES (10);\nSAVEPOINT sp_1;\nINSERT INTO test_sp VALUES (20);\nSAVEPOINT sp_2;\nINSERT INTO test_sp VALUES (30);\nROLLBACK TO SAVEPOINT sp_1;\nINSERT INTO test_sp VALUES (40);\nROLLBACK TO SAVEPOINT sp_2;\nCOMMIT;",
