      "codeSnippet": "DECLARE\n    CURSOR c_emp IS SELECT employee_id, salary FROM employees WHERE department_id = 50;\nBEGIN\n    FOR r IN c_emp LOOP\n        UPDATE employees SET salary = r.salary * 1.05 WHERE employee_id = r.employee_id;\n        COMMIT; -- Commit ngay bên trong vòng lặp!\n    END LOOP;\nEND;\n/",
